ur10e.xml is derived from MuJoCo Menagerie's universal_robots_ur10e/ur10e.xml
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie, the model's own license
above, BSD-3-Clause, itself derived from the ROS-Industrial ur_e_description
URDF). Kept: kinematics, inertials, joints, actuators and collision shapes.
Changed: the visual meshes are dropped (the collision shapes are drawn instead),
and a floor, lights, a wrist camera, a scene camera, a wrist force/torque sensor
and a few objects are added.
